  Nordic Sweaters and Merino Longsleeves
</div>
<div class="centered-article-text" style="padding-top: 10px;">
  <p>
    New to our FW20 product assortment are 3 knit styles made from 100% wool and a Merino wool/cotton blend. Wool is the original performance fiber that came before modern synthetic filament yarns. Prized for resisting wrinkles, wool is durable, repels water (clothing made from wool dries much quicker than other natural fibers), and is even resistant to combustion. 
  </p>
