 	Coming in Grass Green and Dark Navy is our long sleeve collared polo shirt. Having a split yarn composition of 45% cotton and 55% merino wool, the shirt can be worn next your skin and it’s washable, although we recommend gentle care for the garment. The Merino wool has an extremely soft handfeel and if you choose to wear it next to your skin it naturally will help you regulate your temperature due to its sweat wicking properties. The center front placket is finished with natural smoke and cream colored river shell buttons that have custom etched branding.
